{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "I need to share some important findings from my classroom pilot. My end-of-pilot notes show that the project is instructionally ready only for grade 8 -- not grade 7. Additionally, each interview session requires exactly two supervising adults, not one, because students are working with recording equipment alongside community guests. The draft plan still has the original scope of grades 7 and 8 and only one supervising adult per session, so those two elements need to be updated before approval."}
```

