{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "I need to flag a critical privacy issue. The district privacy review, which I completed, requires that all recordings remain on the district's encrypted internal server -- not cloud-based storage. Additionally, recordings must be deleted exactly 45 days after the exhibit closes, not the 90-day retention period currently in the draft. Finally, signed guardian consent must be obtained before any student records an interview. The draft still uses the preliminary cloud-storage language, so these three elements need to be corrected before Dr. Chen signs off."}
```

